<!DOCTYPE html>
<!-- Quantum HTML + CSS example 08_typography/20: Quotation marks -->
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Quotation marks</title>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: #1f2933;
      background: #f5f7fa;
    }
    .demo { max-width: 60rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1.25rem; }
    .demo > h1 { margin: 0 0 0.25rem; font-size: 2rem; }
    .lead { margin: 0 0 2rem; color: #52606d; }

    q { quotes: "\201C" "\201D" "\2018" "\2019"; }
    .fr q { quotes: "\AB\A0" "\A0\BB"; }
    .de q { quotes: "\201E" "\201C"; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="demo">
    <h1>Quotation marks</h1>
    <p class="lead">quotes sets the marks q uses, per language.</p>
    <p>English: <q>She said <q>hello</q> to me.</q></p>
    <p class="fr" lang="fr">Fran&ccedil;ais : <q>Bonjour tout le monde</q></p>
    <p class="de" lang="de">Deutsch: <q>Guten Tag</q></p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
